  "reviewNotes": [
    "Eight package records agree across root Windows release/packages/checksums, the original build and install manifests, original package audit and frozen delivery inventory; file existence, regular-file type and exact sizes were checked. Package bytes were not rehashed/rebuilt/re-unpacked by this lightweight review.",
    "Eight retained original runtime reports match original audited SHA values and each retains ten passed checks plus actual nonempty native saved string maps, hydration and cache restart evidence. Overall original run remains failure while the four selected jobs are success.",
    "Existing non-Windows packages.json fields and prior checksum lines are unchanged for Penguintrack, Last Track and Dirt Crown. Night Racer had no old packages.json and correctly marks Android/macOS pending.",
    "README links resolve. Windows 10 1903+/11 x64, installed WebView2, WebGL 2, unsigned Authenticode, 96 DPI-only coverage and untested physical controller/full completion limitations remain explicit.",
    "Delivery README distinguishes 960x540 pre-connection menu images from 1280x720 connected ID evidence. Existing independent visual reviews were referenced, not repeated.",
    "Dirt Android preparation continues to bind f57e091; Windows documentation explains extended root metadata without altering old Android evidence.",
    "During this review the new 4d71ccf retention exporter (separate from this delivery) was found to incorrectly require nativeSavedAfterQuit is True. Real original maps exposed the issue; root was notified and a separate correction plus real eight-report regression was prepared. This is not a defect in these original reports or packages."
  ],
